  <h1>An inbound AI concierge for a home services business</h1>
  <p class="lede">A caller phones a heating and air conditioning company about replacing a furnace. An AI agent asks for the service address, reads it back, saves the lead to a customer profile, and hangs up after saying goodbye. Sentiment is scored on every utterance and the lead is qualified when the call ends. This page shows how the pieces connect and what happens on one call, hop by hop.</p>

